of the M-43 Army Field Jacket. The field jacket changed what it meant to be a soldier and to look like a soldier. And it changed what we all wear every day, not only Americans, but all around the world. The United States military did not put their soldiers in wool overcoats because they thought it was the best technology. They did it because other countries put their soldiers in wool overcoats.
野战夹克改变了作为一名士兵的意义，也改变了士兵的外观。它改变了我们每个人每天穿的东西，不仅是美国人，而是全世界的人。美国军方让士兵穿上羊毛大衣，并不是因为他们认为这是最好的技术。他们这样做是因为其他国家让他们的士兵穿羊毛大衣。

